              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Solomoni baisa mweba abati, “Munonko alekutiina pakuba imfumu. Ena nabutuka ele konena na ku nsengo shabulambo eko ekele. Alandile nokutila, ‘Ndefwaya imfumu Solomoni ilape kuli ine ukuti tayanjipaye ku lupanga.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
